  ⚠ vue(no-deprecated-html-element-is): The `is` attribute on HTML element are deprecated.
   ╭─[no_deprecated_html_element_is.tsx:1:16]
 1 │ <template><div is="my-component"></div></template>
   ·                ─────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Vue 3 only allows `is`/`:is` on native HTML elements when the value is prefixed with `vue:` (e.g. `is="vue:my-component"`); otherwise rename the tag to the component directly.

